{"objectClass": "NSDictionary", "root": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "book", "text": "豆包工作：14天玩转AI办公", "lineColor": "#244F78", "children": {"objectClass": "NSArray", "0": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "c372b693634e5c4595fb47d847", "text": "前言　当AI从“能聊天”走向“能干活”", "lineColor": "#244F78", "children": {"objectClass": "NSArray", "0": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "f10ac8df3bf6566a832504a37a", "text": "一、这本书为谁而写", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "1": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "9daba6b6453b55a2b9baa34733", "text": "二、本书的主线与特色", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "2": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "7dd9c9b0f4e352d3990b7b14e1", "text": "三、怎样阅读和练习", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "3": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "50d6b27d03b95d2babdfce78bf", "text": "四、配套资源与勘误", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "4": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "7bdb506b177f51ce87b069d056", "text": "五、版本、术语与责任", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "5": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "4e405b39a46a50fb950d320ec1", "text": "六、关于AI辅助与致谢", "lineColor": "#244F78"}}}, "1": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "f916102d22ca5ab3bf72c26b4f", "text": "第一篇　认识与上手篇", "lineColor": "#244F78", "children": {"objectClass": "NSArray", "0": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "ch1", "text": "第1章　认识豆包工作：产品定位与能力边界", "lineColor": "#244F78", "children": {"objectClass": "NSArray", "0": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "40195d54c5135afda58afeb086", "text": "1.1　AI办公进化史：从聊天机器人到Agent", "lineColor": "#244F78", "children": {"objectClass": "NSArray", "0": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "e89a57fbc2215a9ea37bcb4d12", "text": "1.1.1　三次能力跃迁：从回答问题到推进任务", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "1": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "4d73972696c45aaca82bf4b589", "text": "1.1.2　Agent的核心：目标、工具与反馈闭环", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "2": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "089a0e844a9d55f4bd94a571b4", "text": "1.1.3　从“生成内容”到“完成工作”，中间还差四道关", "lineColor": "#244F78"}}}, "1": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "782f11c736065226b88b885392", "text": "1.2　豆包工作的发布背景与产品定位", "lineColor": "#244F78", "children": {"objectClass": "NSArray", "0": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "89459a24d5bc556dacffe7691f", "text": "1.2.1　从分散能力到统一任务入口", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "1": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "1f5c87dd82055aa19ef1bb16cb", "text": "1.2.2　产品定位：面向生产力场景的桌面办公Agent", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "2": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "88fd8f4362c050419b48e6c653", "text": "1.2.3　三层认知：助手、工具使用者与受控执行者", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "3": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "929e9119d80950a1a93ea9b6c2", "text": "1.2.4　产品能力来自模型、工具与工作流的组合", "lineColor": "#244F78"}}}, "2": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "9564d43ccee153e29896344c0d", "text": "1.3　豆包工作与豆包：定位和使用边界", "lineColor": "#244F78", "children": {"objectClass": "NSArray", "0": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "d78188a20ffd5c5a9dfd0b6801", "text": "1.3.1　从对话支持到任务执行", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "1": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "491cecb938355ae1b1ed9358c2", "text": "1.3.2　按任务尺度和复杂度选择运行方式", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "2": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "191c143e34ba5488b7999232f5", "text": "1.3.3　用“明确度×影响度”决定委托深度", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "3": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "e36a6251267058b9acfc591c7f", "text": "1.3.4　从一项真实工作练习分层委托", "lineColor": "#244F78"}}}, "3": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "508e6f396d76508fad8eadec25", "text": "1.4　与同类产品的比较：从功能清单回到工作上下文", "lineColor": "#244F78", "children": {"objectClass": "NSArray", "0": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "6768696b75385d38b5d419ddfe", "text": "1.4.1　主要产品格局与定位差异", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "1": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "c2f11a5060125166b3723225ea", "text": "1.4.2　豆包工作的差异化重点", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "2": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "89a7536f47b45f009ad1a71837", "text": "1.4.3　不要看一次演示，用同一项真实任务做选型测试", "lineColor": "#244F78"}}}}}, "1": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "ch2", "text": "第2章　快速上手：完成第一个办公任务", "lineColor": "#244F78", "children": {"objectClass": "NSArray", "0": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "a91b6837997e56b38101fac652", "text": "2.1　第一步：选择使用入口并完成安装", "lineColor": "#244F78", "children": {"objectClass": "NSArray", "0": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "efbd221b42105f13abc3af3e9b", "text": "2.1.1　选择适合自己的入口", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "1": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "13a8b4bb16ee527ba8f247ca7a", "text": "2.1.2　完成安装并确认结果", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "2": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "791b674af46251739689811fad", "text": "2.1.3　为首次使用保留一份环境记录", "lineColor": "#244F78"}}}, "1": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "a897c6931f8054a9a7a842c536", "text": "2.2　第二步：选择与任务匹配的登录身份", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "2": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "96654bc8fb605175b9a8b5a908", "text": "2.3　第三步：创建第一个办公任务", "lineColor": "#244F78", "children": {"objectClass": "NSArray", "0": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "899d93c61890593884271e52ce", "text": "2.3.1　沿着任务流程认识界面", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "1": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "d2848f7d79245398990311f40f", "text": "2.3.2　照着界面创建练习任务", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "2": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "8733b65b5f755dcea29ecfc350", "text": "2.3.3　区分对话与办公任务", "lineColor": "#244F78"}}}, "3": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "9d6ce515d8655bc4acca536282", "text": "2.4　第四步：建立独立、可控的工作环境", "lineColor": "#244F78", "children": {"objectClass": "NSArray", "0": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "e6381dba3a385329a21a638682", "text": "2.4.1　建立专属工作目录", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "1": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "be4e9bbf7e0c5f35bdbfc758f9", "text": "2.4.2　按任务授予必要权限", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "2": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "4c36707919395676a70a6c1fa1", "text": "2.4.3　把材料整理成一个可交接的任务包", "lineColor": "#244F78"}}}, "4": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "b43d20a64ac75b1bae3eb0a94c", "text": "2.5　第五步：完成并验收会议纪要任务", "lineColor": "#244F78", "children": {"objectClass": "NSArray", "0": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "bd96ae8b628d59259b48fe78a9", "text": "2.5.1　准备材料并下达任务", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "1": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "b2e3750e069e5b16aeb98181f8", "text": "2.5.2　观察执行并处理确认", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "2": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "58c6b353c7d15359a5cef007b2", "text": "2.5.3　验收结果并处理常见故障", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "3": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "f3f7b6161f04587985855a07b1", "text": "2.5.4　第一次任务验收卡", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "4": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "1cda1c4a3d095b2ea757d5a897", "text": "2.5.5　把第一次成功变成可以重复的流程", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "5": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "ac6e3558b6845f0baebc69bb84", "text": "2.5.6　从练习材料切换到真实工作前再过一遍边界", "lineColor": "#244F78"}}}}}, "2": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "ch3", "text": "第3章　核心概念：理解Agent的工作方式", "lineColor": "#244F78", "children": {"objectClass": "NSArray", "0": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "b74a7dd65e98552d945ce666b8", "text": "3.1　Agent怎样完成一项任务", "lineColor": "#244F78", "children": {"objectClass": "NSArray", "0": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "1a2ccef589a75d2c83eeea1008", "text": "3.1.1　从一句要求到可执行步骤", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "1": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "77439fe5d3145718ab8e0847a4", "text": "3.1.2　遇到异常时，先判断谁有权决定", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "2": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "7deb67ddade15a849dcb270db3", "text": "3.1.3　上下文与任务状态决定下一步是否可靠", "lineColor": "#244F78"}}}, "1": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "3c2cb9da54e059daaf4b22af19", "text": "3.2　任务在哪里运行，又通过什么工具完成", "lineColor": "#244F78", "children": {"objectClass": "NSArray", "0": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "2d9f80e39ab25883b443a783f8", "text": "3.2.1　本地与云端：先看材料、软件和数据边界", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "1": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "79deab8bad6c59948b1d5fa3fc", "text": "3.2.2　浏览器是工具入口，不是第三个执行地点", "lineColor": "#244F78"}}}, "2": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "0bba83d5ad8259379665774432", "text": "3.3　把要求写成可执行、可验收的指令", "lineColor": "#244F78", "children": {"objectClass": "NSArray", "0": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "9c3dc04e14be5092ba57921d54", "text": "3.3.1　四类信息共同定义一项任务", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "1": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "1586f1b3bab55422861abc6254", "text": "3.3.2　用“初始指令—执行确认—结果验收”逐步收敛", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "2": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "f527125725a6521bb2773315d7", "text": "3.3.3　复杂任务先写“完成定义”，再讨论怎样执行", "lineColor": "#244F78"}}}, "3": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "3571a8d22a905510a96855e810", "text": "3.4　在关键节点监督，并在必要时接管", "lineColor": "#244F78", "children": {"objectClass": "NSArray", "0": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "362a106e463357c99d98dad1f7", "text": "3.4.1　看懂过程信息，及时发现偏差", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "1": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "8dd1352e562d5968bbe517c3c8", "text": "3.4.2　识别必须由人决定的节点", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "2": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "98b81da50d6252c6bd05e6004f", "text": "3.4.3　任务失败后先定位，再缩小范围重试", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "3": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "b649549a3a4954db9e4a264c7f", "text": "3.4.4　用故障分层决定是改指令、换材料还是换路径", "lineColor": "#244F78"}}}, "4": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "874c24252eda53c4986eb13c81", "text": "3.5　管理异步任务，而不是被动等待", "lineColor": "#244F78", "children": {"objectClass": "NSArray", "0": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "e68fc8968e8458bd88d9b8d65f", "text": "3.5.1　用任务结构估计耗时", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "1": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "5c39dda9e25155f190e66b90a4", "text": "3.5.2　让任务状态和交付结果可追溯", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "2": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "a58990b216a357b8aab3da1724", "text": "3.5.3　用任务交接卡避免“系统完成、工作失联”", "lineColor": "#244F78"}}}}}}}, "2": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "8d70cdf9690554e7850c7bf53f", "text": "第二篇　核心交付篇", "lineColor": "#244F78", "children": {"objectClass": "NSArray", "0": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "ch4", "text": "第4章　文档写作：从材料整理到正式成稿", "lineColor": "#244F78", "children": {"objectClass": "NSArray", "0": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "8582bad3e50c5c44905580970f", "text": "4.1　先判断AI应该介入哪个环节", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "1": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "c4c3be1f537a5a178810f1f22a", "text": "4.2　从会议记录到可执行的纪要", "lineColor": "#244F78", "children": {"objectClass": "NSArray", "0": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "d9d2576f5bfe588fa8019473fa", "text": "4.2.1　先确认材料，再设计纪要结构", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "1": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "bc3e0e68e8a058deaad3811fc3", "text": "4.2.2　把口头讨论还原为事实、结论和行动", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "2": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "77c80627edff5f9eb936e61db9", "text": "4.2.3　区分纪要、摘要和对外信息，不让文种越界", "lineColor": "#244F78"}}}, "2": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "dc0eeb2aaca7513fbe1e0490a6", "text": "4.3　从零散材料到方案与报告", "lineColor": "#244F78", "children": {"objectClass": "NSArray", "0": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "2a3c7877a3515eda8f1ec25951", "text": "4.3.1　先盘点证据和信息缺口", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "1": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "03609d95401758c3981e0f32b4", "text": "4.3.2　先审骨架，再分段生成正文", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "2": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "ec542a7da50d5123ab0a231194", "text": "4.3.3　让建议与证据保持可追溯", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "3": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "25784d48d9f854e597f09fe5fb", "text": "4.3.4　用证据台账控制事实、判断和引用", "lineColor": "#244F78"}}}, "3": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "756a58b8de705641a925977fab", "text": "4.4　从初稿到定稿：控制修改范围", "lineColor": "#244F78", "children": {"objectClass": "NSArray", "0": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "9c3e7f42db6e56e182d954520b", "text": "4.4.1　修改要求要包含对象、动作和约束", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "1": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "73dbff5571805fc497c36cef58", "text": "4.4.2　局部修改也要检查连带影响", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "2": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "b10ca2287e3f53aeb1ca1937f5", "text": "4.4.3　把修改拆成可核对的变更集", "lineColor": "#244F78"}}}, "4": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "2955afe0c4925ad38c766c8690", "text": "4.5　交付前完成一次系统验收", "lineColor": "#244F78", "children": {"objectClass": "NSArray", "0": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "ebd90d2112ac5808805dc8b832", "text": "4.5.1　用五层检查代替笼统校对", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "1": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "0435d76d617c5ab0af7546eecc", "text": "4.5.2　把成稿连同依据和未决事项一起交付", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "2": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "3231595a8b2c5cdd871e57a5a4", "text": "4.5.3　文档交付清单", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "3": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "467ac668ceb452d398397d96dd", "text": "4.5.4　完整案例：把一组项目材料整理成决策简报", "lineColor": "#244F78"}}}}}, "1": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "ch5", "text": "第5章　PPT制作：从汇报目标到现场表达", "lineColor": "#244F78", "children": {"objectClass": "NSArray", "0": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "fd7d79139e5858f282b56058c2", "text": "5.1　先定义一次汇报，而不是先规定页数", "lineColor": "#244F78", "children": {"objectClass": "NSArray", "0": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "41b9deb92a3655b3a331164454", "text": "5.1.1　用四个问题确定表达方向", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "1": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "fff1de544f1355b98cee4019b2", "text": "5.1.2　把制作要求写成验收条件", "lineColor": "#244F78"}}}, "1": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "f5551290552056fdbc8a6bf463", "text": "5.2　根据材料完整度选择生成路径", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "2": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "a4f7aec173e957fcb667f96808", "text": "5.3　把大纲变成页面叙事与视觉系统", "lineColor": "#244F78", "children": {"objectClass": "NSArray", "0": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "fb72ce6fce83529098c3a2c1bb", "text": "5.3.1　先搭建叙事骨架", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "1": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "994b72c2d82751dfa6eba7f3e3", "text": "5.3.2　让标题表达结论，让视觉承担证据", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "2": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "7bae68e979ff5dbeaebe3da87a", "text": "5.3.3　把旧PPT当作规则来源，而不是复制对象", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "3": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "a3967cd2d78258179e3dd44296", "text": "5.3.4　控制信息密度和强调层级", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "4": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "0162522c7cb656e0b8017aa507", "text": "5.3.5　为每页结论保留证据入口", "lineColor": "#244F78"}}}, "3": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "eb60fff20ce75d509b4bfee20f", "text": "5.4　从页面初稿到可交付演示", "lineColor": "#244F78", "children": {"objectClass": "NSArray", "0": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "4249fdbbf6c05c93a0d1f476a0", "text": "5.4.1　局部修改之前先判断影响范围", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "1": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "3cd09eadd06455308ce8e40893", "text": "5.4.2　按“事实—叙事—视觉—现场”完成验收", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "2": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "c345e83fc0d15976bef6513799", "text": "5.4.3　把讲者备注和真实设备演练纳入制作流程", "lineColor": "#244F78"}}}, "4": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "d0548deeb1b3579eab830d59cd", "text": "5.5　综合案例：把一次活动构想做成成套材料", "lineColor": "#244F78", "children": {"objectClass": "NSArray", "0": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "2401acd3969c5105a4a2f8084a", "text": "5.5.1　成套材料交付清单", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "1": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "e30e56ffe8085f748528ab65b6", "text": "5.5.2　用“事实母版”管理跨媒介一致性", "lineColor": "#244F78"}}}}}, "2": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "ch6", "text": "第6章　表格与数据分析：从数据整理到分析结论", "lineColor": "#244F78", "children": {"objectClass": "NSArray", "0": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "79723841b018517d88473315ed", "text": "6.1　选择并理解数据源", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "1": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "601e14f73172504eb9a94277a4", "text": "6.2　数据清洗、合并与批量处理", "lineColor": "#244F78", "children": {"objectClass": "NSArray", "0": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "5c1d1ec06fc35d4b990977046e", "text": "6.2.1　先定义规则，再处理数据", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "1": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "70f06a2cf6ed53d28b63522476", "text": "6.2.2　跨表合并后，先验证记录没有被遗漏或重复放大", "lineColor": "#244F78"}}}, "2": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "1fad32361606534192d0d7830c", "text": "6.3　数据可视化：让图表服务于问题", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "3": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "1000c2fd931c50a9b9dff67271", "text": "6.4　从分析结果到业务判断", "lineColor": "#244F78", "children": {"objectClass": "NSArray", "0": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "ea2486a2c1545ea4aeab1732ec", "text": "6.4.1　从事实、假设到可验证的经营判断", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "1": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "c4db89d9640a56c1bbc304a3da", "text": "6.4.2　把原因假设转化为下一轮可验证的问题", "lineColor": "#244F78"}}}, "4": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "1bf65550a61553838fe3d8813b", "text": "6.5　把口径写进指令，把核验留到交付前", "lineColor": "#244F78", "children": {"objectClass": "NSArray", "0": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "432d2a754c475113891635f93a", "text": "6.5.1　完整案例：建立可重复生成的经营月报", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "1": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "dde865a8774a554db1e6e4fc05", "text": "6.5.2　让交付工作簿既能阅读，也能复算", "lineColor": "#244F78"}}}}}, "3": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "ch7", "text": "第7章　深度调研与专业分析：从检索到研究报告", "lineColor": "#244F78", "children": {"objectClass": "NSArray", "0": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "e06b339641a15f34848f398a5f", "text": "7.1　建立深度调研的五步工作流", "lineColor": "#244F78", "children": {"objectClass": "NSArray", "0": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "a8ab528c9c05501b8f3464397a", "text": "7.1.1　从“找资料”转向“回答研究问题”", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "1": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "727d88734db85d83bef3f4e3b4", "text": "7.1.2　一条合格的调研指令应写清五类信息", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "2": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "0a7b4b77bc975e668578867a58", "text": "7.1.3　用追问修正证据，而不是只润色文字", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "3": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "0da78aaca94a546aa94e4dbeef", "text": "7.1.4　明确公开检索、内部信息与人工判断的边界", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "4": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "f1ea9fb76a9e5a449730615598", "text": "7.1.5　先画检索地图，再决定什么时候停止", "lineColor": "#244F78"}}}, "1": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "b6206b3e9be25e24946bb6961a", "text": "7.2　用两个表格案例完成受控试跑", "lineColor": "#244F78", "children": {"objectClass": "NSArray", "0": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "ca21f7ee06ac5bd1b734a81f31", "text": "7.2.1　校招岗位表：先验证检索与整理链路", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "1": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "d486a990366d5a2fb92c1553c1", "text": "7.2.2　考研择校表：表格完整不等于信息可信", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "2": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "0fb932d7eeb8543b97a75bdb0b", "text": "7.2.3　用错误样本检验结果，而不是只看整齐的前几行", "lineColor": "#244F78"}}}, "2": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "68d6edf819b150b29e67a5709c", "text": "7.3　进阶实战：把考研择校表升级为可信报告", "lineColor": "#244F78", "children": {"objectClass": "NSArray", "0": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "bb25b42f693c52809e057fc9a7", "text": "7.3.1　第一步：把目标拆成可核验的调研清单", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "1": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "d2229d99ddb459a78c4f2ea436", "text": "7.3.2　第二步：按来源等级进行多渠道检索", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "2": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "01e81db88b8050d6938f706696", "text": "7.3.3　第三步：筛掉低质材料，建立证据表", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "3": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "44aad8a506255033ade7baa020", "text": "7.3.4　第四步：用独立来源核对，而不是机械凑够两个链接", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "4": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "6778f287e948580c958232f731", "text": "7.3.5　第五步：生成带证据、限制和待办的报告", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "5": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "05b68af3f661598b89c31ee968", "text": "7.3.6　把研究材料写成真正支持决策的报告", "lineColor": "#244F78"}}}}}}}, "3": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "9ac04c2b59ca578b9e941cfd5d", "text": "第三篇　进阶执行与创作篇", "lineColor": "#244F78", "children": {"objectClass": "NSArray", "0": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "ch8", "text": "第8章　操作电脑与浏览器：让跨软件任务保持可控", "lineColor": "#244F78", "children": {"objectClass": "NSArray", "0": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "27343f411bd552fe8e141bfb81", "text": "8.1　任务开始前，先划定权限和数据边界", "lineColor": "#244F78", "children": {"objectClass": "NSArray", "0": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "9f20222b764c5685a38bdc4b0a", "text": "8.1.1　权限只覆盖完成当前任务所需的范围", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "1": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "55ccdb5f712e5abd87db0a4898", "text": "8.1.2　不要把风险控制完全交给系统提示", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "2": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "13d84c394d535db7b8e8bae62c", "text": "8.1.3　把授权写成任务级权限单", "lineColor": "#244F78"}}}, "1": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "f7004d1845a25222b3327dea10", "text": "8.2　浏览器任务：把页面操作拆成可核对步骤", "lineColor": "#244F78", "children": {"objectClass": "NSArray", "0": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "f433a05bc4705615b25bead269", "text": "8.2.1　信息收集要保留来源和时间", "lineColor": "#244F78"}, "1": {"objectClass": "MindNode", "ID": "513606cf3ad45e6b990f5f5968", "text": "8.2.2　表